<title>USA: Elk Grove District, Ill., yields 5.35 pct in 2009.</title>
<headline>Elk Grove District, Ill., yields 5.35 pct in 2009.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Chicago Capital Markets Inc said Wednesday it tentatively priced $8.1 million Elk Grove Park District, Ill., refunding bonds at a top yield of 5.35 percent in 2009.</p>
<p>The preliminary pricing follows:</p>
<p>ELK GROVE PARK DISTRICT</p>
<p>RE: $8,140,000*</p>
<p>COOK COUNTY, ILLINOIS</p>
<p>GENERAL OBLIGATION PARK REFUNDING BONDS</p>
<p>SERIES 1996</p>
<p>BANK QUALIFIED</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aaa		   S&amp;P: NR</p>
<p>FGIC INSURED</p>
<p>    DATED: 10/01/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 04/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 04/01</p>
<p>MATURITY		 AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
