<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Thursday, October 3, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on October 23, 1996.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry through DTC.</p>
<p>First Chicago Capital Markets, Inc.</p>
<p>Griffin, Kubik, Stephens &amp; Thompson, Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
